              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रगड़ना — ragaṛnā — \"to rub\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुनार ने सोने को पत्थर पर रगड़ा। sunār ne sone ko patthar par ragaṛā. The goldsmith rubbed the gold on a stone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने हाथ रगड़े, usne hāth ragaṛe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रगड़ना (ragaṛnā) goes back to ragg, \"rub\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 10558), which lists Hindi ragaṛnā. Goldsmiths test gold by the streak it leaves when rubbed on a dark stone."
            }
          ]
        },
